  "an4.142:1.1": "Catasso imā bhikkhave pabhā. ",
  "an4.142:1.2": "Katamā catasso? ",
  "an4.142:1.3": "Candappabhā, suriyappabhā, aggippabhā, paññāpabhā. ",
  "an4.142:1.4": "Imā kho bhikkhave catasso pabhā, ",
  "an4.142:1.5": "etadaggaṃ bhikkhave imāsaṃ catunnaṃ yadidaṃ paññāpabhā ti. 143. ",
  "an4.142:1.6": "Cattāro 'me "
}
